      deck: 'Standard 52-card deck with the 8s, 9s and 10s removed, leaving 40 cards. Four suits; rank in each suit from high to low: Ace, 7 (manilha), King, Jack, Queen, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2.',
      equipment: '40-card deck (8s, 9s, 10s removed).',
      dealing: 'Deal 10 cards to each player. Bottom card turned for Trump.',
